{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/89075-what-breaks-if-i-fitter-happier-s-resonance-rewrite","id":89075,"title":"What Breaks If I: Fitter Happier's Resonance Rewrite","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-11T15:49:46-07:00","id":89075,"title":"What Breaks If I: Fitter Happier's Resonance Rewrite","content":"<a href=\"http://www.rpdom.com/resources/i-will-make-of-this-world-a-torture-chamber-resonance-rewrite-by-fitter-happier.747/\" target=\"_blank\">I Will Make Of This World A Torture Chamber</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">0: The Abyssal\u2019s doom is held at bay. She sleeps the sleep of the just.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">1-2: The Abyssal has taken small steps in a forbidden direction. She gains a single Venom at the first level. </span></span><i>Ex: 1st Venom, 1st level.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">3-4: Within the Executioner\u2019s chest, her keter-soul begins to shiver and bleed. She gains a </span></span><i>second</i><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Venom at the first level. The player must choose a new Venom that falls under a different category from her existing Venom (Internal rather than External, or vice versa). If any points of Resonance in the track are generated by preserving a forbidden relationship, the player must choose a Personal Venom, if she has not done so already. She also advances her original Venom to the second level. </span></span><i>Ex: 1st Venom, 2nd level; 2nd Venom, 1st level.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">5-6: The Black Exaltation keens like a wounded animal. The Abyssal advances her second Venom by another level. With two Venoms at level two, she may choose to gain a third Venom at level one, or advance her original Venom to its final level. The third Venom may be of any type. </span></span><i>Ex: 1st Venom, 3rd level; 2nd Venom, 2nd level.</i><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> OR </span></span><i>1st and 2nd Venom, 2nd level; 3rd Venom, 1st level.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">7-8: Hyperventilating in agony, the Abyssal-keter razors its broken-shard edges against the soft places of the Executioner\u2019s soul. Its keening grows ever louder. If the Abyssal possesses a Venom at its final level, she gains no new ones. If the Abyssal does not, she must advance her third Venom another level. </span></span><i>Ex: 1st Venom, 3rd level; 2nd Venom, 2nd level.</i><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> OR </span></span><i>All Venoms, 2nd level</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">9: The weight of her blasphemous karma now nearly inescapable, every waking moment becomes horror. The Black Exaltation extends tiny mausoleum-tendrils that are visible in the whites of the Executioner\u2019s eyes and its screaming is audible as a subsonic whine. The player must advance her first Venom to its final level. If has already done so, she advances her second Venom to its final level. </span></span><i>Ex: 1st and 2nd Venom, 3rd level.</i><span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">OR </span></span><i>1st Venom, 3rd level; 2nd and 3rd Venom, 2nd level.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Open Sans\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">10: At the highest level of Resonance, the Abyssal becomes an apocalypse-in-miniature. One Venom at the third level, of the player\u2019s choice, spontaneously re-asserts its effect, regardless of what cool-down periods this might violate. The Abyssal may avoid this fate by suffering two levels of Aggravated damage. At the end of the scene, whether through the blasphemies of her Venom or the blood of her wounds, this final point of Resonance is expiated.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>What break if:<br /> <br /> You gained 1 dot of Venom per offence, to be placed within a Personal, External or Internal Resonance pool. The level corresponds with the dot, and that's it. Your place the dot where you wish upon getting it.<br /> <br /> 1. If one of these pools is full, up to three, giving you a third level Venom, and you gain another dot, then you may either re-assert that Third level effect or suffer two levels of Aggravated damage instead of putting that dot into an unfilled pool (If you even have one left).<br /> <br /> 1a. If you have three dots in a Resonance Pool, you may start another pool of the same type with a different Venom rather than putting the dot into your unfilled pool. (IE, if your Internal Resonance pool is three-dots filled, using the Venom Of Withered Flesh, you may start a new Internal Resonance pool using the Venom Of Fearful Words)<br /> <br /> 1aI. If you have two dots<br /> <br /> 1aII. If you have one dot","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","name":"God_of_Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1252_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T15:44:06-08:00","id":1180906,"title":"","content":"Has anyone got a copy of the resonance rewrite saved? The link is dead","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachme